-- The WITHIN after ONCE is a deadline on the whole, a NUMBER like the act's.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) ONCE ALL HAVE WITHIN "soon" HENCE FULFILLED
